# FOR DEVELOPING THIS PLUGIN, NOT FOR USING IT.
#
# A .env here is the LOWEST-priority source and the only one that does not survive
# a plugin update: an installed plugin lives in a version-pinned directory, so
# publishing a new version leaves this file orphaned in the old one.
#
# If you INSTALLED this plugin, put your key in the Keychain instead. Run this in
# your own terminal, where -w prompts for the value without echoing it:
#
#   security add-generic-password -s demoday -a FAL_API_KEY -w
#
# Full resolution order, first hit wins:
#   environment  ->  keychain  ->  ~/.config/demoday/config.json  ->  .env
#
# See README.md for the rest.

# Required — all voice, presenter and b-roll generation goes through fal.ai.
# Get a key at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys
FAL_API_KEY=

# Optional — stock image search for b-roll reference frames.
# Get a key at https://brave.com/search/api/
BRAVE_API_KEY=

# Optional — custom character voices designed from a prose description
# (gen/voice-design.mjs). Without it, narration uses fal.ai stock voices.
# Get a key at https://elevenlabs.io/app/settings/api-keys
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=
